{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you want to change how information is logged by TanStack Query, you can set a custom logger when creating a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","value":"const queryClient = new QueryClient({\n  logger: {\n    log: (...args) => {\n      // Log debugging information\n    },\n    warn: (...args) => {\n      // Log warning\n    },\n    error: (...args) => {\n      // Log error\n    },\n  },\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deprecated"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Custom loggers have been deprecated and will be removed in the next major version.\nLogging only has an effect in development mode, where passing a custom logger is not necessary."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nIf you want to change how information is logged by TanStack Query, you can set a custom logger when creating a `QueryClient`.\n\n```tsx\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n  logger: {\n    log: (...args) => {\n      // Log debugging information\n    },\n    warn: (...args) => {\n      // Log warning\n    },\n    error: (...args) => {\n      // Log error\n    },\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Deprecated**\n\nCustom loggers have been deprecated and will be removed in the next major version.\nLogging only has an effect in development mode, where passing a custom logger is not necessary.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: custom-logger\ntitle: Custom Logger\n---\n\nIf you want to change how information is logged by TanStack Query, you can set a custom logger when creating a `QueryClient`.\n\n```tsx\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n  logger: {\n    log: (...args) => {\n      // Log debugging information\n    },\n    warn: (...args) => {\n      // Log warning\n    },\n    error: (...args) => {\n      // Log error\n    },\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Deprecated**\n\nCustom loggers have been deprecated and will be removed in the next major version.\nLogging only has an effect in development mode, where passing a custom logger is not necessary.\n"}
